      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAVOC ONE (1) produced a PB time this course in distance last time, finishing second behind Skedaddle Benny in a Grade 5 but still recording a dazzling 22.64. Going well and rates on top. PAY RUBY (7) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 3.5 lengths from the winner (23.22). Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has the ability to give this a shake. JUMPING GEM (8) has found the minor placings here at last couple of runs, finishing third last time beaten 7 lengths (23.20). Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. GRAPEFRUIT ZIPPY (3) deserves plenty of thought over this distance.",
